OL,3,GNEWSAMother wins fight to get free
OL,4,Aschool transport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has won her fight to get free
OL,7,Fschool transport for three of her
OL,8,Fchildren after a mix up with a now
OL,9,Fdefunct county council.
OL,11,FSam Shuttleworth, who lives near
OL,12,FSedbergh in Cumbria, but just over the
OL,13,Fborder into North Yorkshire, would have
OL,14,Fhad to move her children to a North
OL,15,FYorkshire school, or pay nearly #3,400
OL,16,Fa year for a bus to Kirkby Stephen.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1790314026
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMother wins fight to get free
OL,4,Aschool transport
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council, one of
OL,7,Ftwo authorities replacing Cumbria
OL,8,FCounty Council, apologised to the
OL,9,Ffamily saying it was "a historic
OL,10,Fmapping system error" that led to
OL,11,Ftransport arrangements being
OL,12,Fincorrectly assessed.
OL,14,FShuttleworth said it was "brilliant"
OL,15,Fnews and was pleased the council had
OL,16,F"used common sense" after causing her
OL,17,Fworry.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
